{"reviewId": "254854030_85EWhJ7PQ", "review": {"type": 1, "bookId": "3300128305", "chapterUid": 6, "content": "资源品是指直接从自然界获取、未经深度加工或仅经简单加工的基础性产品，是工业生产和经济运行的核心原料，主要分为三大类：\n1. 能源类资源品\n用于提供动力和热量，包括原油、天然气、煤炭、页岩油、铀矿（核能原料）等。\n2. 工业金属类资源品\n支撑制造业和基建，包括铁矿石、铜、铝、锌、镍、铅、锡、钴、锂（新能源核心原料）等。\n3. 农业及软商品类资源品\n保障民生和轻工业，包括粮食（小麦、玉米、水稻）、油脂油料（大豆、菜籽、棕榈油）、棉花、橡胶、木材等。", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "abstract": "农业与其他资源品相比，特殊性就在于它的供给受到天气的极大影响。所以，农业价格的研究逻辑一直十分重视太阳黑子运动。", "range": "18068-18124", "chapterName": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "chapterIdx": 6, "reviewId": "254854030_85EWhJ7PQ", "userVid": 254854030, "topics": [], "createTime": 1766654325, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "author": {"userVid": 254854030, "name": "薄荷白桃乌龙茶", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/DYAIOgq83eotCrwSFSicibG99Nkf5vrg0ff5gIBNXvxUEHLjQOgqCkgge06Nib9Vp2791QZZJPKUpm1JVpXRn1RoA/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M13-20240826-10", "desc": "每周阅读挑战", "title": "完美阅读周", "levelIndex": 10}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 10, "likes": [{"userVid": 36185863, "name": "Jin", "avatar": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/mtj05m8fb4iaECEmw2Ogx9gNDiaNVa0BcU71icNdaXOqhsg6ibsKtibMWBvJs34GNc2PwcOtTv0ntr10/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M3-0-500", "desc": "阅读天数", "title": "阅读天数", "levelIndex": 500}}], "commentsCount": 2, "hotComments": [], "comments": [{"c